Description: Provides a workflow for psychometric scale construction that
    combines large language model item generation, semantic embeddings, ant
    colony optimization, exploratory structural equation modeling with
    'lavaan', dynamic fit-index calibration, pseudo-factor-analysis diagnostics,
    and publication-ready visualizations. The package supports cloud and local
    model backends while keeping network-dependent examples optional during
    automated checks.
